  m_text: 'Well and after all of that... I don''t really know what happened. If my
    creator decides to make me more cases then i had more cases, but if she does
    not, then i was just probably chilling I guess...

    One thing still keeps
    bugging me though. Why would anybody put a RESET button on all their bombs and
    lose a BOMB DEATIVATION MANUAL near all of them. People never stop to surprise
    I guess...'
